flowchart LR
  U[Candidate + profile] --> UI[JobOS UI<br/>pipeline · live browsers · reasoning trace]
  UI -->|POST /api/hunt · SSE| API[FastAPI orchestrator]
  API --> D[Discover<br/>TinyFish Search x4 ATS domains, parallel]
  D --> RQ{Resolve each posting<br/>cheapest tier first}
  RQ -->|0| C[(SQLite cache<br/>TTL per fact kind)]
  RQ -->|1 Greenhouse/Lever/Ashby| ATS[Public job-board APIs]
  RQ -->|2 Workday/unknown| F[TinyFish Fetch ttl=0]
  RQ -->|3 forms / login gates / ambiguous| AG[TinyFish Agent run-sse<br/>tight goal + output_schema<br/>≤2 concurrent]
  AG -->|STREAMING_URL| UI
  ATS & F & AG --> X[Cross-check + schema validate<br/>confidence + evidence per field]
  X -->|closed| G[Ghost / stale filter]
  X -->|open| M[Gemini 2.5 Flash structured output<br/>fit score, quoted evidence, grounded answers]
  M --> V[Evidence verifier<br/>drops claims not in resume]
  V --> RK[Rank]
  RK -->|user clicks Prefill| P[TinyFish Agent prefill<br/>submit-guard cancels run]
  P -->|live view| UI
